The {{Term/Store|Zora Helm|Zora Helms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Zora Helm is a piece of [[Armor]] that can be found in [[Toto Lake]]. Wearing it will grant [[Link]] [[Swim Speed Up]] and allow him to execute a [[Spin Attack (Added Effect)|Spin Attack]] while swimming.<ref name=" BotW Inventory"/> The Zora Helm, alongside the [[Zora Armor]] and [[Zora Greaves]], compose the [[Zora Set]]. It can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] or [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

